Radioactive is a 2019 British biographical drama film
starring Rosamund Pike as Marie Curie.

11
01:11:49,411 --> 01:11:55,411
It was directed by Marjane Satrapi and written by Jack Thorne, who adapted the 2010 graphic novel
Radioactive: Marie & Pierre Curie: A Tale of Love and Fallout by the American artist Lauren Redniss.

12
